Cell["\<\
The ball dimension falls from 1.75 at step 0 to 1.10 at step 115. The ball \
dimension of a uniform sample of a flat 3D periodic box reads 1.64 to 2.57 at \
200 points and 2.05 to 2.38 at 1000 points. It reads 3 within 0.1 only near \
10,000 points, so at 200 to 1600 points the reading does not give the \
dimension of the space the points sample.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1987333543,ExpressionUUID->"2f4595f3-090a-1216-557a-0cbda8bf617c"],

Cell["\<\
The ball scalar curvature and the number of components at each step:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->616753397,ExpressionUUID->"06385f5e-e9d4-4e6c-2fd8-571b886114b6"],

